{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7ef9361712af4f2a","name":"1st-Degree Droid Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-7ef9361712af4f2a","title":"1st-Degree Droid Talent Tree","revision":19384,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:51:20Z","sha256":"72fea6876fa83a4a1d1b172fed5e6000a7fee6deb682e96844e6acfd680cbc83","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19384","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=1st-Degree%20Droid%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7ef9361712af4f2a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["1st-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/1st-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:52f4f8736865db41"}," are usually Medical, Analytical, or Scientific Droids. Only they can select Talents from this Droid Talent Tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dull the Pain"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Medical Programming"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", you can make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check on an adjacent living creature to move it +1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Interrogator"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can create an aura of unliving, emotionless, menace that no biological creature can match, and combine it with the cruel application of medical knowledge. You can use your ",{"tag":"a","childr